  "_asked_for_but_not_carried": {
    "_note": [
      "Children ask for these by name. We do not carry them, and most never will be.",
      "",
      "Each maps to an honest alternative, shown under a line that says we do not",
      "have the thing asked for. Never pretend these are the same. An entry mapped",
      "to nothing shows no tiles at all, which is the right answer when there is no",
      "honest alternative.",
      "",
      "Every one of these results, with tiles or without, carries the download line:",
      "in the NotSus browser a parent can add any site, and this page cannot. A",
      "search that misses is the one moment a download pitch answers a question the",
      "child just asked. See docs/WEBSITE-REPLICA-PRD.md, 'When the search misses'."
    ],
    "_miss_line": "We do not have {asked}. These let you do something like it:",
    "_empty_line": "We do not have {asked}, and there is nothing here like it.",
    "_download_line": "Looking for something that is not here? In the NotSus browser, a parent can add any site.",
